One of my healers found the helm of vision a great asset at the
castle, saving him precious turns [a]pplying his unicorn horn instead
of hacking things with Cleaver. I thought, "Hmm, maybe I should wear
this through Gehennom". Two minutes later I met a magical eye. Bye-bye
helm of vision. :)

Seriously, it's not a helm I'd use in an ascension kit - or *anywhere*
in Gehennom -  unless it protected from all gaze attacks, which is
certainly overkill. But it's useful enough in many tight situations
that I'd be happy to find one. At least it's a helm, and as such can
be quickly removed.

BTW, Derek, I haven't found any of the new shields. Have they been
implemented/activated yet? And the Gauntlets of Force didn't seem too
special. Are they only applicable in bare-handed combat?




